WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,660
I'm serious

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:02,860
I'm not kidding

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:05,250
I brought it all to your mouth

4
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:12,320
Don't you even open your mouth, Miss Liu?

5
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,400
This joke is a bit too much

6
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,320
angry

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,000
You are too calm to be alarmed.

8
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,240
Okay, I won’t tease you anymore.

9
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,560
Put on your clothes and come out with me to buy some things.

10
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,480
I can't drive

11
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:34,850
I'm afraid not. I have to watch her. What do you want to buy? Is it urgent?

12
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:40,500
I can't tell you what you want to buy. If I tell you, she will kill me. Don't worry.

13
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,540
She won't run around

14
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,020
She's hiding in the bathroom like this now

15
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,180
I don’t even dare to wear pants.

16
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,680
The supermarket is closed. Where can I buy it?

17
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,990
Just find an open convenience store.

18
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:06,930
Did you learn to drive in the army?

19
00:01:07,770 --> 00:01:09,290
What kind of soldier are you in the army?

20
00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:10,450
Are they special forces?
